**Read:** [Mineralogy — Dexter Perkins, open editions](../sources/Mineralogy-Perkins.lingua#r_3Y3EJ93EG4V7Q0TZBCRRXVNVKP), the complete reciprocal-space, diffraction, and indexing treatment; [A laboratory manual for X-ray powder diffraction — Poppe and colleagues](../sources/USGS-X-ray-Powder-Diffraction-Manual.lingua#r_3S2AET1HS289HRQBDJ87A30DX6), the full relevant measurement/identification material; [GSAS-II — diffraction analysis and refinement tutorials](../sources/GSAS-II-Refinement-Tutorials.lingua#r_14B5VSDN6YR5MQJVNTKYJXF3XB), the complete instrument/model preparation used.

Under the stated elastic-scattering geometry, Bragg's relation nλ = 2d sin(θ) connects spacing, wavelength, and angle. Many powder plots report 2θ, so confusing it with θ changes the answer. State radiation/wavelength, angular convention, reflection order or equivalent indexing, and units.

For invented λ = 0.15406 nm and d = 0.2820 nm in first order, θ = asin(λ/(2d)) and 2θ is about 31.70°. This calculation is geometric, not identification of a named mineral. Combine it with the actual reciprocal metric, reflection conditions, observed peaks, and composition.

Indexing proposes lattice/metric relationships for a set of observations. A plausible cell fitting a few peaks can be nonunique or affected by impurities, missing peaks, or instrumental offsets. Peak position precision is not the same as accuracy of the cell model or proof of a full atomic structure.

**Work:** derive/check the teaching result independently, propagate a stated hypothetical angle/wavelength uncertainty, and compare two reflections of a specified cubic model using d_hkl. Test whether a proposed assignment explains all relevant observed positions, absences, and unassigned peaks. Identify which additional observation can discriminate a competing indexing or phase-mixture account.

Read the full reciprocal/diffraction treatment. Use a documented instrument standard or known material during practical work, preserving its own uncertainty and conditions rather than calibrating solely to the unknown pattern being interpreted.

**Continue:** [Evaluate a refined pattern through model, residuals, correlations, and evidence](Whole-pattern-refinement-and-quantitative-phase-analysis.lingua#r_75FAFYT5JQC9ZPHSE8RDMPMF9V).

